WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.500
The original sample.png image file.

00:00.500 --> 00:01.083
Select the image and drag its thumbnail.

00:01.083 --> 00:01.783
Hold Shift to open the image conversion wheel.

00:01.783 --> 00:02.133
Hover the BMP destination.

00:02.133 --> 00:02.383
Hover the PDF destination.

00:02.383 --> 00:03.033
Choose WEBP.

00:03.033 --> 00:03.417
Release. Citrus shows the real conversion status.

00:03.417 --> 00:04.000
The original PNG and new sample.webp remain together.
